≈ 75%–105% do débito-base)\" — 500,000/665,584 = 75.1% ✓, 700,000/665,584 = 105.2% ✓ \"75%–105%\" ✓.\n\n50. Line 33: \"2019: 3 = out–dez\" ✓ CSV: 2019 qtd 3 valor 54,000 = 3×18,000 ✓; 2026 9 NFs 162,000 ✓; total: 54,000+216,000×6+162,000 = 54,000+1,296,000+162,000 = 1,512,000 ✓ = 84×18,000 ✓.\n\nNext, read parecer.json, STATUS.md, QUESTIONS.md. Also try PDF text extraction to verify contract clauses.\n","metadata":{"reasoningField":"reasoning"},"time":{"start":1792983078290,"end":1792983124924}}}
