king an inconsistent comparison; also §7 says \"weighted value (85/15 → ≈ 648k; 75/25 → ≈ 625k)\". Verify: 0.85×665.584+0.15×443.722.67 = 565.746.4+66.558.4 = 632.304.8 ✓. 0.75×665.584+0.25×443.722.67 = 499.188+110.930.67 = 610.118.67 ✓. Weighted HE: 0.85×16.568.18+0.15×11.045.45 = 14.082.95+1.656.82 = 15.739.77 ≈ 15.740. 632.304.8+15.739.8 = 648.044.6 ≈ 648k ✓ consistent with §7. 75/25: 0.75×16.568.18+0.25×11.045.45 = 12.426.14+2.761.36 = 15.187.5 ≈ 15.188 ✓; 610.118.67+15.187.5 = 625.306.2 ≈ 625k ✓ consistent with §7. So fix the mixed row in §6.1 to consistently show HE in both mixes: \"Mix 85/15 → verbas 632.305 + HE ponderada 15.740 = 648.045; mix 75/25 → verbas 610.119 + HE ponderada 15.188 = 625.306\". This matches §7's ≈648k/625k.\n- Also, line 173's \"(atualizada rodada 2 — cliente confirma ausência de documentos) (updated in round 2 — client confirms absence of documents)\" — the checkpoint flagged label verification; QUESTIONS.md says Q-A was closed in the closing round (still on the same date 26/10). Round 2 = Q-A presented and closed? From the earlier STATUS output: \"Rodadas 1 e 2 encerradas... (rounds 1 and 2 closed...) inclusive for Q-A\"; QUESTIONS says \"Q-A (nova na rodada 2) — ENCERRADA (closed)\". The statement \"the client confirms the absence of documents\" was in response to round 2 (per §6.1 item 3: \"Confirmed on 2026-10-26 (round 2): the client stated they have no additional information/documents\"). So \"(atualizada rodada 2)\" is correct. Keep.\n- Line 186: \"(formula: `stf_tema_1389_pejotizacao.md` and `verbas_e_calculo.md`)\" → delete \"and `verbas_e_calculo.md`\" — wait, does verbas_e_calculo.md mention correction? From the full-text reading above: there is **no** mention of IPCA/SELIC/Law 14.905. Confirmed: formula only in the tema_1389 file. ✓ fix.\n- Line 194: \"R$ 850k spreadsheet\" is fabricated → rewrite. Actual notice: communication of contract termination + intent to file a lawsuit claiming recognition of employment relationship from 2019-10-01 \"including all monetary payments\", filing scheduled for 2026-11-16. No amount stated. Rewrite: \"having received an extrajudicial notice announcing a labor lawsuit claiming 'all monetary payments' from October 2019, and having an internal legal opinion on file, why did it not recognize any provision?\" This preserves the argument (the notice = disclosure trigger, awareness) without the fabricated amount.\n- Line 100 (the sensitivity (mês dividido: half-month) item in §5): flag the dates December 20, 2021 / September 29, 2022 as [unverified]. Actually, let me check `cf_art7_xxix_prescricao.md` to see if there is any description of due dates. Needs reading. Also verify the \"+49k\" figure: the maturation model's additions: 2021 13th-month salary (matures on 2021-12-20, inside the 5-year window? For filing on 2026-11-16, cutoff is 2021-11-16; 13th-month salary 2021 matures 2021-12-20 → not time-barred → +1 full 13th-month salary of 16.500 (11/12? hmm) ... the summary says: \"16,500+28,000=44,500; +FGTS/40% → 49,484\". 16.500 = 11/12 × 18.000? hmm, that's 16.500. Or the proportional 13th-month for one month? Anyway — the summary says ≈+49k is verified: 44.500 × 1.112 (FGTS 8% + 40% penalty = 8%×1.4 = 11.2%) = 49.484 ✓. So keep +49k; add [unverified] flag to the specific dates. Let me check the cf file.\n\nAlso need to confirm: does cf_art7_xxix include the maturation-date model? Let me read.\n\nAlso line 16 (overview): \"up to about R$ 160k if extrapolated\" ✓ (160.159).\n\nAlso parecer.json line 28: need to read the JSON to fix. And check whether JSON's fundamentos etc. mention 160 hours or 19.600.\n\nAdditionally, per the checkpoint's next-move item: STATUS.md item 3 and QUESTIONS.md Q3 refer to the divergence between the 160-hour spreadsheet × 135 hours — since the arithmetic **is correct**, those stay as is.\n\nLet me read STATUS.md and QUESTIONS.md fully, parecer.json fully, and the remaining library files (cf_art7, tst_sumulas, clt, multa, INDEX) to complete verification. Then run Python verification. Then apply edits.\n","metadata":{"reasoningField":"reasoning"},"time":{"start":1792983215305,"end":1792983248748}}}
